  "description": "PIYVEC crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H68 Gd4 N4 O22. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.608-3.805 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.00-105.75°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C54H68Gd4N4O22. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
